Your offer and your price.

195
00:07:27,185 --> 00:07:28,174
Safe parking,

196
00:07:28,194 --> 00:07:30,053
clean toilets and clear signs.

197
00:07:30,073 --> 00:07:31,920
Your booking system, your website,

198
00:07:31,940 --> 00:07:33,138
